At *Sheesh Grill*, Exceptional customer service and quality food is at the core of everything we do. We achieve together, embrace diversity and work hard to get it right.

Our passion is to serve real food that makes people happy and to do this, we need the right people. When you cook for our guests, they need to feel the passion.

*Your key responsibilities will include, but are not limited to:*

*Role:*

* Assist with putting away deliveries, stock rotation, stocktake and the dating of our products;
* Ensuring all Standard Operating Procedures are followed;
* Ensuring correct processes are followed even when procedures are updated to reflect changes in regulations;
* Contribute to full compliance processes including regular temperature checks and the cleaning of all back-of-house spaces;
* Contribute to the consistent quality of our great menu.
* Help prepare food for service such as salad items, sauces, dressings, etc,
* Making wraps, burgers, plates and platters quickly but up to the highest standards,

*Key Ingredients:*

* Previous experience working in a similar role;
* You care about the quality of your work and the work of your team;
* You’re passionate about working in a team in a fast-paced environment;
* You’re a constructive, positive, and considerate communicator;
* You have a love of food and exceptional customer service;
* Flexible to work both weekday shifts and weekend shifts;

_Sheesh is an equal opportunity employer and encourages applications from people with culturally and linguistically diverse backgrounds._

*Apply now to join the Sheesh family with your resume and cover letter and join our passionate team.*

Job Types: Part-time, Casual

Pay: Up to $29.23 per hour

Benefits:
* Employee discount

Work Location: In person
